        {
          "text": "Samuelini aadaafi huji hayyu biyyati hime eege kitaaba keesati t'aafe, fulla woyyuma AABBO Waaqa dura kaye. Jennaani Samuelini nama ch'ufaani worra keesaniti gala jed'e gad'iise. ",
